# armour/shared/pauldron_lobed5_r: the great LOBED pauldron on the right shoulder (lobed.5; FORGE-MANTLE, the envelope: PLAN "The envelope", STYLE_P2 29).
# petals: a round upper petal over a lower one, the outline notched between them and the foot scalloped into
# round lobes, the heart a gem (PARADE, gilded; the envelope's great / legend size).
# 5 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (26 across with its pair); the side views the large
# size's width + 1, hanging lower. Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: R the petals' scalloped hem, G the petal's heart, N the line between petals, P the petals' faces.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-MANTLE gen56.py from shapes56.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
